#: scenario5:scenario5_7F9C6881_0D0B_448C_963B_E47E326BBE54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92acdcc0c909ec3d7872ed627530ab4a074b62216fe53dce6e9fba9ab231c158
#. default-sha256: 0935c621a7967c70f381887c24789f7a40b8bd25cb044f76c88043eb2d0d4451
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F9C6881_0D0B_448C_963B_E47E326BBE54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It had been a little under "
"two weeks since I had moved in with Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫ミシェルと共に暮らしてから、"
"⟪k:13⟫十日あまりが過ぎていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A2B2C3A3_E67B_4632_A11A_A01A64AC1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5703a2088be90227793ff64abdebf623817e4c6a3703cbb394fc525fcd566652
#. default-sha256: 65e1fce1fc640b5d988ef399172ae97c9100b616ac6ec5de0f4f6634019b5842
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A2B2C3A3_E67B_4632_A11A_A01A64AC1CB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though we lived in the same house, we rarely saw each other."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫共に、⟪k:1⟫と言っても、⟪k:2⟫顔を合わせる機会はあまりなくて――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A965A44_8F80_40BF_A5E1_D86B24CE088C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 279e9444fc4dd0e2e42d24ef92f000423112f96992302dbac64493f1099b4b85
#. default-sha256: 0191de4873150b44ec300daa3cf4c7648efddabdae743a30cf8b9cbd81a4743a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A965A44_8F80_40BF_A5E1_D86B24CE088C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On unlucky days, I wouldn’t see him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ひどいときは、⟪k:1⟫丸一日姿を見ない時もあった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85E8BFB9_F381_4DD1_BD7C_4527A9E775B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8b6e85eacddd93c3b4b8a7045f86ef78c5ff301adc7f69b221bb880a700dd20
#. default-sha256: e50f5b8f1b3d72e2db70c9159ecb033cfc5e8f322bd9929c3d2b1f8bf6a749f0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85E8BFB9_F381_4DD1_BD7C_4527A9E775B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure if he ate in his room or our schedules were simply misaligned, but we never "
"had any meals together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫食事時も時間をずらしているのか、⟪k:1⟫あるいは自室で食べているのか分からなかったけれど、⟪k:2⟫"
"席を共にしたことなんてなかったし……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5BCFB35_20B8_4F12_9B50_57F5C20CAF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98c3d11bfbecdbaf3191d44630f70b61d01152937e890a30973cf540cb268029
#. default-sha256: 4136e1179d7be995eb94aaa19899aa1af0c90cd9fe958b1f5ab40760a9184350
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5BCFB35_20B8_4F12_9B50_57F5C20CAF1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Perhaps he was deliberately avoiding me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もしかしたら、⟪k:1⟫意図的にわたしと関わらないようにしているのかも。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CBF3FE2B_D765_47F6_BB1B_2ECF64E875C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 962160b9d5f76e54919f95f147867d98bef3947d6790aed73d849b379b3a554b
#. default-sha256: 05b02ce9a67e4e151967ff17108b75724ffcd818464b325d7943a276e1b50697
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CBF3FE2B_D765_47F6_BB1B_2ECF64E875C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That has to be it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫やっぱり、⟪k:1⟫避けられてるのかしら……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C1E720E_D5B5_4FCD_86BC_ACBADC321ACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b09574c39659cb6613f1076241720284184c8950ab061babd646d68b9674befe
#. default-sha256: 1610228fa39eca18b9e459c1e0a776983f60fd9f3ae867174953f7de91c66e5a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C1E720E_D5B5_4FCD_86BC_ACBADC321ACB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know servant and master don’t usually eat at the same table,⟪k:1⟫but even so..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫屋敷の主と使用人という立場なんだから、⟪k:1⟫そりゃあ、⟪k:2⟫一緒のテーブルでご飯食べたりなんか"
"しないだろうけど……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6CBD4980_1912_4BFE_B443_1D7A16551157
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91345d1ac0a1000cc3fd723b9d50b8f2367902e5dce127b5328fbeee74d9fcec
#. default-sha256: 19fa96a2d963d1782569ea739059a2b3be6f5ab669cfae59c3cefe60a6438c4b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6CBD4980_1912_4BFE_B443_1D7A16551157"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He could be a little less obvious about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫なにもあからさまに遠ざけなくてもいいのに。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EA9C66EA_A57E_400D_A70B_91B4F80816DA
