msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5B8E17F4_A3C4_419A_A00C_994A0502EBCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fcfd65923ee16aed803758f32846f075ae0dae5ef2e0fe660cf212e6096cc9b
#. default-sha256: c762a731430a57364fa19c9c313a26119bf6e6759c299d7a73255d6012b7c666
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5B8E17F4_A3C4_419A_A00C_994A0502EBCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Am I really that much of a nuisance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんなに、⟪k:1⟫邪魔なのかしら……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA276AAF_86AF_4D04_9849_50FCA2D525C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 180032e37e83ae8cebc2720a382b401fa8ec81a8c0626f8fbaec54893f308946
#. default-sha256: ef3765b9d46bf34501734855d7866d4c27758455506fa7435738c679886442a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA276AAF_86AF_4D04_9849_50FCA2D525C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m not doing anything inappropriate, am I?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m being pleasant and sociable, aren’t "
"I?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたし、⟪k:1⟫悪いことしてないわよね……？　⟪k:2⟫明るくしてるわよね？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DF3F6E2A_FF8E_4D95_805F_7A18C50830D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a62b6ca867b3aae02301451ed9bdc343deadb51643b63263c91fc4f268ab7edb
#. default-sha256: 4f91bc3cf9c225153cf8ebc745eb3209b8a659ccdf11995a90408f0479d8db33
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DF3F6E2A_FF8E_4D95_805F_7A18C50830D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I haven’t given him any reason to not like me, I think.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hope..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫きらわれる理由、⟪k:1⟫ないと思う…………思いたいんだけど。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C945864B_F126_41CF_AB15_A799D69A1064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 014ed60492e2a3d8f9e12c022274e65db594191c8e516bc033ae060ea21b11e1
#. default-sha256: a5108b75bbc617754c9c90e0c26ab1c47f037c37fb417776e6fd8960171ccddc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C945864B_F126_41CF_AB15_A799D69A1064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never been very enthusiastic about my staying here,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫確かに、⟪k:1⟫最初の時から、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫わたしがここにいるのを快くは思われていなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA31EB28_082D_47A3_BB1A_CF08485A11A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 308dd43c8f5b4e4eee8244a1d7e06977231f8f8480d14835553cf2811f22eb1a
#. default-sha256: 1764a1756f3c26e4aab77dd9b3d07f0bae91224abc55949e96fe0cfdc088aee6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA31EB28_082D_47A3_BB1A_CF08485A11A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I hadn’t been given a choice. ⟪k:1⟫I had been sent here by his family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でもわたしだって、⟪k:1⟫ここに行けと――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あの人の実家から言われた身なのだし……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_285A114B_CE40_48E8_A101_D05970835748
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56c6c076229f0bfbad538c0f1c4ab5977aea40aea0d9baaecb818eb88afa9dd1
