msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc9183a4c423d39cbcb8f8ffc1a61ee08966db7043cc5370fd22c417813f56fa
#. default-sha256: 53ea509646bb89abb023b54fac9797f7b02a3d66f352575a8315e7e1e6234eec
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No. Out with the negative thoughts. ⟪k:1⟫Gotta stay positive.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yeah! He hasn’t tried "
"to chase me out yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫悪い方に考えちゃだめだわ。⟪k:1⟫前向きにならなきゃ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そうよ！　⟪k:4⟫出ていけって怒鳴"
"られたわけじゃないんだし。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2d86fc5b3a72ddaf2f681ed37629aa5d84c0a5bbbd9d6b49b9b612e7476125f
#. default-sha256: dab9c7e8f0cfdccd0c65b4b3adef15473e55dab51a2db147e1fb1493c45b1a88
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just... ⟪k:1⟫haven’t broken the ice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まだ……、⟪k:1⟫うまく付き合えていないだけだわ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7da238d2d3127aac75a36e56b9a22f827dc15b502f2e825241bc9c6ca6e61796
#. default-sha256: a7d15264e2f89a8c76af4689e3d99acef037cb32802ba306d3063762fa667daf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to stay positive. ⟪k:1⟫Optimistic. ⟪k:2⟫Happy thoughts. ⟪k:3⟫And be myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……そう。⟪k:1⟫前向きに、⟪k:2⟫やっていかないと。⟪k:3⟫前向き、⟪k:4⟫前向き。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫わたしらし"
"く、⟪k:7⟫明るく。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e4b8420c7ee6b7564540ef33393354c8393f4e05da972f275da6df7a9ee8b19
#. default-sha256: 29619eefc76d1ba2ff81055a0b2072fb3af88a1ed29d36af0f244bf984f7c18b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as I kept working at it, with enough time, Michel would surely come around and not "
"be so distant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫時間をかければ、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルだって普通に接してくれるようになるはず。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫だから、⟪k:4⟫"
"頑張らないと……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c084fe6d57fc5944e12e686713df1301c45b2652025e503bb59659b8e08454fd
#. default-sha256: 3e4464637115be3a216fa68f5010a5af507b0a3fcbd7b48a2619cbdfecef5f2f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve got a goal, so let’s get to work!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First, I make supper, then I ask him to have "
"it with me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そうと決まれば！　⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫夕飯の支度をして、⟪k:3⟫今日こそは一緒に食べないか誘ってみないと！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef1ffbecc2191601c6343ea81e6bdfbefeaf938697591fc66fb742dbb7ce4bf8
#. default-sha256: 3345699cc3aaa50d0d62fe7d88024ef9f21b392d55bd13e2b8a1f4368f34daed
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gotta be proactive when it comes to the reclusive types.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All right, here goes!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ああいうジメジメ～っとしたタイプには、⟪k:1⟫こっちから行かないとだめなんだわ。⟪k:2⟫よおし、"
"⟪k:3⟫仲良くなるわよ！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 285386b3ff82e315513724c74a611827c7e28dc0df1d3e854598b792e67385a6
#. default-sha256: fadd78281431b3279a5639bf2e16bf738133182fa2b85ce13b941367c795a850
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Or, here ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ go..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………と、⟪k:1⟫いっても。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5087da6a41693dba3b95fc9eaef65535fad3e959ca9bd6c0e24ac59b005c4ab2
#. default-sha256: c56de2906174303957b22236c581d56ea9258e0f157d45058775a0ad4e97d0a5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but we’re almost out of supplies."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そろそろ、⟪k:1⟫食料が尽きそうなんだけど。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae3f50ed5605c79a95493321a9d7971503709a40e4af6ab3ef0d944998491c59
#. default-sha256: 835780969ecdea19deb31da45486b4c06f676f67a3f45a78bc0b324d9759134b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, so much for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………こまった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c092975a7504da79d72d7ab7d61380f6c724bb80b424299b824c3e2de31c4e49
#. default-sha256: 0d82cc5a0c1b3aebcd99145957c959a76b4e3ac0bb9de737ec9bc94bfc2bd0a4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where the nonperishable food was stored. ⟪k:1⟫Dried foods, smoked meats, "
"cheeses, and a small scattering of root vegetables."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫地下の倉庫には、⟪k:1⟫日持ちする食料が置かれていた。⟪k:2⟫燻製だとか、⟪k:3⟫乾き物だとか、⟪k:4⟫"
"チーズだとか。⟪k:5⟫あとは少しばかりの根菜。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b055a9c83ee3dda6b5454411ba3fe67063b7a24e33af566cc68fca01b4ec58e
#. default-sha256: 79df4b191659c386a2e074cf0971bc7ebb6ee987f0bdfd2a50a060f8c53d9fe0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Looking at this makes me feel like a soldier holding down a castle’s fortifications."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まるで篭城している兵士の気分よね。"

